; META 4K — the Meta ribbon and wordmark as pure
; mathematical light, on a living white field.
; Pure Krell, 3840x2160.
;
; THE RIBBON is not the symmetric Bernoulli
; lemniscate of the earlier emblem films. The
; centreline is a trigonometric polynomial —
; Fourier series through the seventh harmonic in x,
; y and z — fitted by least squares to the
; reference mark's own medial axis: the logo's
; blue mask was measured, its two loop holes
; located, and 44 centreline points ray-cast from
; the hole centres over the far arcs and snapped
; along the crossing strands (fit_ribbon.py;
; max error 17 px on a 1164 px mark). Depth is a small fitted series
; separating the strands at the crossing, plus a
; drifting swim harmonic. Its frame is
; differential geometry evaluated numerically:
; tangent, normal and binormal from the curve's
; first and second finite differences (the jet of
; the curve), curvature kappa from the normal
; component of the second difference. The band is
; woven: 2,200,000 samples of a thread stitching
; across the width on a triangular wave (constant
; crossing speed, so the dwell is uniform and the
; fabric has no fringed edges), two interlaced
; families, golden-ratio jitter, the Moebius
; half-twist in the frame. Colour is accumulated:
; the per-pixel mean of a gradient driven by
; position, a travelling shine, and curvature —
; hundreds of shades of Facebook blue between the
; measured endpoints (0, 96, 219) and (0, 200, 255).
;
; THE FILM starts and ends on the perfect still:
; at frame 0 every motion phase is zero and the
; ribbon sits exactly as in the reference lockup.
; Mid-film the ribbon phi-warps: every surface
; point is mapped through a Poincare-disk Moebius
; automorphism whose centre travels a closed path
; (zero at both ends of the loop), the oscillators
; carrying integer-cycle phase drifts — the PHI
; morph machinery — while the rig swings gently.
; All phases are integer cycles, so frame 300 is
; frame 0 exactly.
;
; THE WORD "Meta" at the right is the reference's
; own letterforms: a packed-bit mask extracted
; from the provided logo, sampled with 2x2
; coverage in the shade pass, in the measured
; slate (25, 40, 48).
;
; THE BACKGROUND is a living white: a shade-pass
; field of three domain-warped sine systems in
; continuous calculus motion (phases 1, 2 and 3
; cycles per film), valued between (233, 240, 250)
; and (255, 255, 255) — thousands of shades of
; white — plus 600,000 particle motes of white
; light drifting on integer-cycle oscillations,
; accumulated in their own buffer and laid over
; everything as sparkle.
;
; Usage: meta4k <frame> — one binary PPM (P6,
; 3840x2160) on stdout. Host services: write,
; malloc, sin, cos, sqrt, atan2, atoi.

extern write(i32, ptr, i64) -> i64
extern malloc(i64) -> ptr
extern sin(f64) -> f64
extern cos(f64) -> f64
extern sqrt(f64) -> f64
extern atan2(f64, f64) -> f64
extern atoi(ptr) -> i32

